            <zone h='35333' id='18' type-v2='text' w='45429' x='54000' y='63778'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>What this means:</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>1. Smoking combined with obesity drives the highest costs: these members are 11% of members but 34% of claim costs.</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>2. Our Forecast estimates each member&apos;s claim cost within about $3,700 on average, less than half the error of a flat estimate, for more accurate budgeting</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>3. Recommendation: Focus prevention programs (quit-smoking, weight managemet) on smokers with obesity, and collect fuller health history to explain the few members whose costs we cant forecast</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
